  }
}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[If your team includes vulnerable adults or children and young people aged under 18, you need to think about safeguarding and child protection. Stoolball England can arrange a CRB check for you.]]></Value>
    </description>
